=== Verify Tate types of pi_d at bad fibers ===

--- Near q = 0 (specialize q = p) ---
  q = 2:  N = 24,  f_2 = 3,  Kodaira = -5
  q = 3:  N = 48,  f_3 = 1,  Kodaira = 8
  q = 5:  N = 240,  f_5 = 1,  Kodaira = 8
  q = 7:  N = 336,  f_7 = 1,  Kodaira = 8
  q = 11:  N = 2640,  f_11 = 1,  Kodaira = 8

--- Near q = 1 (specialize q = 1 + p) ---
  q = 1 + 2 = 3:  Kodaira at p = -6
  q = 1 + 3 = 4:  Kodaira at p = 6
  q = 1 + 5 = 6:  Kodaira at p = 6
  q = 1 + 7 = 8:  Kodaira at p = 6
